## Design Decisions (v1.5)

- **Compressor:** ON at boot, OFF during night mode, ON at morning. No cooldown. No max runtime. Shop compressor with own pressure switch.
- **Burst-cycled relays:** Exempt from relay cycle limits.
- **Manual override:** Activate on first toggle only. Subsequent toggles within 10-min window don't re-trigger shutdown.
- **Relay mapping:** Position-based (1-4). Each position has a GPIO pin and a function assignment. Functions must be unique — validated both client and server side.
- **Identify button:** Toggles the selected function's relay at 2Hz for 5 seconds for physical identification.
- **Graph dashboard:** 350 points max, 8KB heap buffer, 5-second live feed, Chart.js from SPIFFS.
